(4773990, 689465, 58127, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors! The sea matching the sky. Great composition as well - vertically, half and half, horizontally, thirds. All the lines are nice too. Only thing I wish was that your subject was a little more well lit. Still well done.</td>', 'Gorgeous colors! The sea matching the sky. Great composition as well - vertically, half and half, horizontally, thirds. All the lines are nice too. Only thing I wish was that your subject was a little more well lit. Still well done.', '2008-06-18 04:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4773998, 689598, 58127, '<td valign="top">I like the action and the scene. Only thing you could do better is to freeze it more, and open your aperture more. The high contrast with the background like that makes the photograph very busy. Maybe a neutral density filter?</td>', 'I like the action and the scene. Only thing you could do better is to freeze it more, and open your aperture more. The high contrast with the background like that makes the photograph very busy. Maybe a neutral density filter?', '2008-06-18 04:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
