(4775214, 689547, 24896, '<td valign="top">Awesome pic. Love everything about it and sharp as a tac. Just something funny with the blur on the end of the branch(left side)its too blurry for how crisp everthing else is I cant tell if its editing or DOF</td>', 'Awesome pic. Love everything about it and sharp as a tac. Just something funny with the blur on the end of the branch(left side)its too blurry for how crisp everthing else is I cant tell if its editing or DOF', '2008-06-18 18:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4775219, 688821, 93883, '<td valign="top">Sorry for the random comment, must have happened while browsing during voting.  I think this is a really great idea.  The cropping is perfect and the pose is great.  I''m being a bit picky here, but the blood stood out to me as looking unnatural.  It might be the color, but I think it''s that it isn''t flowing in a natural way.  If this had been advanced editing, I wonder how it would look with selective desaturation.  Maybe only leaving the blood and the medal in color, or just the blood.  Great take on the challenge :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-06-25 04:03:34.</i></td>', 'Sorry for the random comment, must have happened while browsing during voting.  I think this is a really great idea.  The cropping is perfect and the pose is great.  I''m being a bit picky here, but the blood stood out to me as looking unnatural.  It might be the color, but I think it''s that it isn''t flowing in a natural way.  If this had been advanced editing, I wonder how it would look with selective desaturation.  Maybe only leaving the blood and the medal in color, or just the blood.  Great take on the challenge :)', '2008-06-18 18:37:51.000000', '2008-06-25 05:03:34.000000', 1),
(4775220, 688800, 24896, '<td valign="top">Great shot one of my favs. Would like to see what if any you cropped out after voting.</td>', 'Great shot one of my favs. Would like to see what if any you cropped out after voting.', '2008-06-18 18:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
