(4775227, 688061, 24896, '<td valign="top">You nailed this one. All around great. Some smoke and a heater would have been awesome. I''ll be upset if your not 1st or 2nd. Good luck!</td>', 'You nailed this one. All around great. Some smoke and a heater would have been awesome. I''ll be upset if your not 1st or 2nd. Good luck!', '2008-06-18 18:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
