(4778148, 689467, 93765, '<td valign="top">If it was that simple ;)  Sorry, but I don''t get the message. Is the background significant? Why an empty frame? Is there some deep philosophical statement implied?<br/>I''m trying to imagine what the effect would be, had you printed your picture and put that one in the frame, then reshot, etc. etc. (but with the ribbon only in the last frame...). Estethically not entirely without charm, food for thought, but a bit too deep for me.</td>', 'If it was that simple ;)  Sorry, but I don''t get the message. Is the background significant? Why an empty frame? Is there some deep philosophical statement implied?I''m trying to imagine what the effect would be, had you printed your picture and put that one in the frame, then reshot, etc. etc. (but with the ribbon only in the last frame...). Estethically not entirely without charm, food for thought, but a bit too deep for me.', '2008-06-20 18:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4778165, 689684, 93765, '<td valign="top">A very nice abstract feel. The blown-out sheet upper right is a bit too dominant, the frame a bit too heavy for my taste, otherwise it is visually pleasing stuff.</td>', 'A very nice abstract feel. The blown-out sheet upper right is a bit too dominant, the frame a bit too heavy for my taste, otherwise it is visually pleasing stuff.', '2008-06-20 18:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4778197, 689009, 93765, '<td valign="top">Good idea, excellent execution.</td>', 'Good idea, excellent execution.', '2008-06-20 18:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4778230, 688409, 93765, '<td valign="top">Conveys the message very well.</td>', 'Conveys the message very well.', '2008-06-20 19:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4778239, 689825, 93765, '<td valign="top">I feel a bit more DOF might have been beneficial, to bring all wings into focus. But even so, a very pleasing image. The repeating colours work very well, the composition is great.</td>', 'I feel a bit more DOF might have been beneficial, to bring all wings into focus. But even so, a very pleasing image. The repeating colours work very well, the composition is great.', '2008-06-20 19:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4778265, 689810, 93765, '<td valign="top">I''m struggling with the symbolism. The white queen is down. OK. The black king is falling? Or just leaning over to watch her go down?</td>', 'I''m struggling with the symbolism. The white queen is down. OK. The black king is falling? Or just leaning over to watch her go down?', '2008-06-20 19:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
