(4782027, 689606, 90658, '<td valign="top">Not many people can catch a bug at the moment of take-off and still keep everything in focus...was this a set-up?  Could this be a plastic bug?  Or are you just totally talented and putting everyone else to shame?</td>', 'Not many people can catch a bug at the moment of take-off and still keep everything in focus...was this a set-up?  Could this be a plastic bug?  Or are you just totally talented and putting everyone else to shame?', '2008-06-23 18:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4782030, 689758, 90658, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the angle of this shot, but as I''m not a photog I really can''t say why it seems off.  Perhaps the Critique Club can help.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the angle of this shot, but as I''m not a photog I really can''t say why it seems off.  Perhaps the Critique Club can help.', '2008-06-23 18:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
