(4786738, 689027, 90387, '<td valign="top">Hello Mike<br/>This is really an impressive image, and one that I think would have done very well in "cool colors", "reflections without mirrors," "water," etc.  Keep this spot tucked away in your brain for another day as it definitely is a keeper.<br/> <br/>edited to add:  Get your butt out of bed more often!  Some of the best photos I''ve ever taken were first thing in the morning before people screw them up :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-06-26 11:21:24.</i></td>', 'Hello MikeThis is really an impressive image, and one that I think would have done very well in "cool colors", "reflections without mirrors," "water," etc.  Keep this spot tucked away in your brain for another day as it definitely is a keeper. edited to add:  Get your butt out of bed more often!  Some of the best photos I''ve ever taken were first thing in the morning before people screw them up :-)', '2008-06-26 12:20:10.000000', '2008-06-26 12:21:24.000000', 0),
